        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "A grievance alleging a violation of Section 6.4 of this article shall be filed initially at Step 2 of the grievance procedure. Such action must be brought within 21 days from the alleged act or occurrence. However, an employee who has filed a complaint alleging sexual harassment under the Commonwealth's Statewide Sexual Harassment Policy may not file a grievance regarding those same allegations under this section.",
